{
    "title": "Mahjong for Seniors",
    "description": "Keep your brain sharp while having fun with this puzzle game of Mahjong Solitaire.\r\n\r\nSIMPLE RULES - MATCH TILES TO WIN\r\nMahjong Solitaire is a very simple and straightforward game. The goal is to clear all the tiles from the board by matching them in pairs. The tiles can only be paired if they have at least one side free and no other tiles on top of them. The drawings and symbols on the tiles must be the same in order for them to match.\r\n\r\nHUNDREDS OF BOARDS, BEAUTIFUL LAYOUTS\r\nWide variety of categories and beautiful layouts. Try different tile sets and backgrounds. Relax and have fun completing the puzzles.\r\n\r\nCHALLENGE YOUR BRAIN\r\nFun will never end as new categories will be available for you to unlock. Plus, every day you will find new Mahjong puzzles to solve with the Daily Missions. If you feel up-to the task, try to beat the time to increase your score, achieve the 3-stars rating and get more coins.\r\n\r\nGot stuck?\r\nYou can use the Shuffle feature when there are no more moves available or the Hint button to find a pair on the board.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Hundreds of boards\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Many categories\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Daily Missions - new boards every day\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Monthly Challenge\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Time goals\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Hints and Shuffle - to help you finish the board\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Unlimited free undos\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Customize tiles and background\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Auto Zoom In\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Highlight free tiles\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Music and sound effects\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Show/hide timer and goals\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Daily Reward - collect prizes every day\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Easy matching gameplay\r\n\ud83c\udc04  Play offline\r\nAnd much more!\r\n\r\nCan you solve this game?\r\nOnly the best players can!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Keep your brain sharp while having fun with this puzzle game of Mahjong Solitaire.<br><br>SIMPLE RULES - MATCH TILES TO WIN<br>Mahjong Solitaire is a very simple and straightforward game. The goal is to clear all the tiles from the board by matching them in pairs. The tiles can only be paired if they have at least one side free and no other tiles on top of them. The drawings and symbols on the tiles must be the same in order for them to match.<br><br>HUNDREDS OF BOARDS, BEAUTIFUL LAYOUTS<br>Wide variety of categories and beautiful layouts. Try different tile sets and backgrounds. Relax and have fun completing the puzzles.<br><br>CHALLENGE YOUR BRAIN<br>Fun will never end as new categories will be available for you to unlock. Plus, every day you will find new Mahjong puzzles to solve with the Daily Missions. If you feel up-to the task, try to beat the time to increase your score, achieve the 3-stars rating and get more coins.<br><br>Got stuck?<br>You can use the Shuffle feature when there are no more moves available or the Hint button to find a pair on the board.<br><br>FEATURES<br>\ud83c\udc04  Hundreds of boards<br>\ud83c\udc04  Many categories<br>\ud83c\udc04  Daily Missions - new boards every day<br>\ud83c\udc04  Monthly Challenge<br>\ud83c\udc04  Time goals<br>\ud83c\udc04  Hints and Shuffle - to help you finish the board<br>\ud83c\udc04  Unlimited free undos<br>\ud83c\udc04  Customize tiles and background<br>\ud83c\udc04  Auto Zoom In<br>\ud83c\udc04  Highlight free tiles<br>\ud83c\udc04  Music and sound effects<br>\ud83c\udc04  Show/hide timer and goals<br>\ud83c\udc04  Daily Reward - collect prizes every day<br>\ud83c\udc04  Easy matching gameplay<br>\ud83c\udc04  Play offline<br>And much more!<br><br>Can you solve this game?<br>Only the best players can!",
